# AICL Example: Insertion Sort
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Sort using insertion sort

Layer:
Core

Behavior Sort
    Input: array
    Output: array
    Action:
        for i in range(1, len(array)):
            key = array[i]
            j = i - 1
            while j >= 0 and array[j] > key:
                array[j + 1] = array[j]
                j = j - 1
            array[j + 1] = key
        return array
